  "body": "Deadline sale: Closes on Friday 6 November 2026 at 2:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nFOUR SOLD. ONE LEFT. YOUR LAST CHANCE IN MILFORD!\r\n\r\nBrand-new. Four bedrooms. Generous 190m² total floor area. Fully standalone. Freehold. Double Westlake school zones. Premium Miele appliances. Plus a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee!\r\n\r\nFinding this combination in the heart of Milford is rare. And with four of the five homes already SOLD, 42D Gordon Avenue is officially the LUCKY LAST!\r\n\r\nTHE SALES SPEAK FOR THEMSELVES:\r\n\r\n42A Gordon Avenue – SOLD!\r\n\r\n42B Gordon Avenue – SOLD!\r\n\r\n42C Gordon Avenue – SOLD!\r\n\r\n42E Gordon Avenue – SOLD!\r\n\r\n42D Gordon Avenue – LUCKY LAST!\r\n\r\nOffering approximately 190m² of total floor space, this beautifully finished home gives your family room to grow without the maintenance headaches of an older property.\r\n\r\nA spacious, sun-filled open-plan living and dining area flows into a sleek modern kitchen fitted with premium Miele appliances. Sliding doors connect effortlessly to a private deck, while upstairs, four well-proportioned bedrooms, including a comfortable master suite, provide space and privacy for the whole family.\r\n\r\nTHE MILFORD LIFESTYLE YOU'VE BEEN WAITING FOR!\r\n\r\nZoned for both Westlake Boys' and Westlake Girls' High Schools, with Milford Beach, Milford Village, cafés, shopping and coastal walks all within easy reach. Enjoy one of the North Shore's most sought-after neighbourhoods, with everyday convenience right on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nMORE REASONS TO MAKE YOUR MOVE:\r\n\r\n\r\n• Brand-new, fully standalone and freehold\r\n\r\n• Four bedrooms with approximately 190m² total floor area\r\n\r\n• Double Westlake school zones\r\n\r\n• Premium Miele kitchen appliances\r\n\r\n• Sun-filled living with a private deck\r\n\r\n• Low-maintenance design\r\n\r\n• 10-Year Master Build Guarantee\r\n\r\n• Title and CCC issued – ready to move in!\r\n\r\n4 SOLD. 1 LEFT. WHEN IT'S GONE, IT'S GONE!\r\n\r\nThe other four homes have already found their buyers. Now there's just one opportunity remaining to join this boutique Milford development.\r\n\r\nWith summer around the corner, imagine celebrating Christmas in your brand-new home, with Milford Beach just minutes away.\r\n\r\nDon't be the one who missed the last one!\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing of 42D Gordon Avenue, Milford.",
